{"product_id":"maple-crest-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Maple x Rosewood (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eCrafted from \u003cstrong\u003ehard maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, the forearm showcases elegant \u003cstrong\u003elong points\u003c\/strong\u003e accented with meticulously handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eresin inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating a clean, sophisticated design that highlights the wood's distinctive figure. A \u003cstrong\u003epremium Brown Luxe wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e offers a luxurious feel and a secure, comfortable grip, while the richly figured \u003cstrong\u003erosewood butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e brings warmth, depth, and a refined finishing touch.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors, the Maple Crest embodies the precision, balance, and exceptional craftsmanship that define every Elite Cue creation. Every element is carefully crafted to enhance both performance and aesthetics, resulting in a cue that is as rewarding to play with as it is to admire. Whether paired with your preferred shaft or displayed as part of a distinguished collection, the Maple Crest is a timeless expression of handcrafted excellence.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ehard maple\u003c\/strong\u003e with Long Points \u0026amp; Handcrafted Resin Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Brown Luxe Wrap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\